      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the Bazel rules, these JNI libs are only ever passed from an aar_import to android_library or android_binary, and in Android, android_libraries [cannot be installed on device](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/java/aar.go;l\u003d900;drc\u003daf8bb7008aee02d162a0d6343b610450ac53dffd). \n\nI think it\u0027s best to replicate this behavior rather than piping this information into the various other java_modules which could depend on an android_library_import.\n\nAdded a comment saying this.",
